# Shared by both images built from this context (./frontend):
#   docker build .                    -> the Streamlit app
#   docker build -f web/Dockerfile .  -> the new React SPA
#
# Without this, Streamlit's build context also drags in the SPA's node_modules.
**/node_modules
**/dist
__pycache__
*.pyc
# Built component bundles are produced inside the images, never copied in.
circuit_composer/frontend/build
live_bloch/frontend/build
web/dist
.git
